"parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 31, "page_number": null, "text": "Why manufacturing? PRODUCTS and YOU Product requirement: FUN (Data/Calculations/processing/information TX) Technical requirement: Effective cooling Tools: CFD simulations to analyse the cooling patterns Engineering consideration: DI water sealed inside the vapor chamber Chamber is laser welded into the Al- chasis Thermal management (carry the heat away) Chamber convects heat, which conducts through the forged Al-body Aero-grade Al-alloy Kth > 20X of Ti6Al4V alloy Lighter and outstanding thermal performance", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.is_title_slide": true, "parser.slide.number": 1, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 32, "page_number": null, "text": "Slide 17", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.is_title_slide": true, "parser.slide.number": 1, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 33, "page_number": null, "text": "Why manufacturing? PRODUCTS and YOU", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.is_title_slide": true, "parser.slide.number": 1, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 34, "page_number": null, "text": "Slide 18", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.is_title_slide": true, "parser.slide.number": 1, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 35, "page_number": null, "text": "Why manufacturing? PRODUCTS and YOU Material preparation & b illet selection Action: Heavy aerospace aluminum (7075 series) billets undergo homogenization. Thermal Control: Inline IR monitors localized heat, locking the environment < 45°C to suppress micro-thermal deformation . Rough milling (Material subtraction) Action: Heavy-duty vertical CNC mills strip over 90% of metal block. Target: Raw display channels, internal battery cavities, and raw side profiles. Tolerance: ±0.05 mm on bulk 5-Axis precision CNC milling Action: sculpt outer chassis curves, side button paths, and thermal channels . Stability: Custom vacuum-clamping beds isolate thin walls to eliminate cutting chatter and tool-induced deflection. Tolerance: Flatness and geometry boundaries are rigidly restricted to ±0.02 mm . Feature drilling and slotting Action: High-speed micro-CNC spindles and automated lasers slice ports, speaker meshes, and structural threads. Focus: Precision boring of rear camera bezels and mating boundaries. Tolerance: Critical camera perimeters are locked at ±0.01 mm ; overall hole locations stay within 0.05 mm . Surface refinement & electrochemical Anodizing Action: Robotic abrasive tracks brush away burrs before components enter an automated electrochemical bath to form a protective coat. Finish Target: Ra between 0.4 µm and 0.8 µm .", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.is_title_slide": true, "parser.slide.number": 1, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 36, "page_number": null, "text": "Slide 21", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.is_title_slide": true, "parser.slide.number": 1, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 37, "page_number": null, "text": "Manufacturing Processes: Need for speed/money/lifestyle/materials/innovation/engineering", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.is_title_slide": true, "parser.slide.number": 1, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 38, "page_number": null, "text": "Slide 22", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.is_title_slide": true, "parser.slide.number": 1, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 39, "page_number": null, "text": "Manufacturing Processes", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.is_title_slide": true, "parser.slide.number": 1, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 40, "page_number": null, "text": "Slide 23", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.is_title_slide": true, "parser.sli